  "description": "Nabezo is a shabu-shabu and sukiyaki specialty restaurant where you can casually enjoy all-you-can-eat authentic shabu-shabu and sukiyaki. Each piece of meat is carefully sliced ​​in-store, and by thoroughly managing the time and temperature after slicing, we serve it to customers in the best condition. Vegetables are sourced directly from trusted farmers all over Japan and are served buffet-style in a \"vegetable market.\" We are open for both lunch and dinner. The nearest station is Shibuya Station.",
